{"v":4,"catch":"物理運算解謎遊戲「Q REMASTERED」的最新作品！\n你能解開由20多位「Q之倖存者」VTuber親自設計的奇特謎題嗎？","desc":"2023年初春於日本掀起實況熱潮的物理運算解謎遊戲《Q REMASTERED》最新作，現已登陸Nintendo Switch™！\n其名曰《VTuber的Q》！\n\n本作收錄了由20多位VTuber親自構思的奇題與難題。\n\n那些曾成功實現杯中取球、掛上衣架的人類啊，是時候迎接我們準備的全新挑戰了。\n\n延續《Q REMASTERED》的獨特魅力——這是一封由深度體驗過《Q》的VTuber們，寫給全人類的挑戰書！\n\n這次的解法也充滿自由，取決於你的奇思妙想！\n還請親自挑戰這款「因簡而難」的Q之新作吧。","publisher":"KYORAKU PICTURES．","release":"2025-06-05","genres":["益智","街機","學習","動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.7GB / Switch 0.7GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f0a831c3197f2ff574387c41c6850a6fdf90724a31f03dc32cf2191fd26c4644.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9a00f1e23ca53776185c3d07af7d796615324e82703abcce062c103fa6a13a9a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/218a2d205920cb94c34d15214c3e9b34bc6765ab0cedee3259e3dfa0e16561a4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e02a4a1e6f5d54cabe2f7837ded729590023665ee923368ff186bce89db8f1b1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a33eb328dedcc22a752e872cc68c44299e32f70a8d0804497bd7302bc8407d81.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/209ef57d98c52357be75905ed29fc433e8c8d0fb5f56846a8e642d831e87037e.jpg"],"titleId":"01009d9022952000","dlc":[]}